Z||000000||BlackDragon||10-10-2001||08:05 PM||||that about says it. im looking for a kit to put a 350 sbc in an 88 toyota truck. it is a 4x4, and i need to keep that. so it has to be a decent kit. anyone out there know where i can get one? prices? <P>note: already posted in o/t but i thought it would get a few more hits this way. also posted in technical chat<P>btw, archie: could you help me??<P><P>------------------<BR>We are all different for a reason.....<BR>you can read a persons soul through there eyes.....<BR>he who argues with a fool is probably one himself.....<BR>big cars may be fast, but i can corner.....<P>BlackDragonsEmail@yahoo.com||||reg||1
Z||000001||danny boy||10-10-2001||11:08 PM||||  I usually just throw 'em in the bed and strap 'em down good. Works with any engine and most trucks acually. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <BR> <BR> My cousin just finished one for a customer. I'll ask him and find out what he used.||||reg||1
Z||000002||BN Boomer||10-11-2001||03:16 AM||||Have you considered a 4.3L V-6 swap? It will fit in the engine compartment easier, weigh less, and you can get some pretty good power out of them.<P>For info on the swap itself, pick yourself up a copy of the latest FOUR WHEELER or 4 WHEEL & OFFROAD and start browsing the ads. Downey Offroad specializes in Toyotas and companies like Advance Adapters and Novak either have or can fabricate parts for just about any engine swap conceivable. Swapping a SBC or 4.3 into a Toyota truck is fairly common and the information you seek you should not be the least bit difficult to find.<P>Good luck.<P>------------------<BR>Greg, aka Boomer<BR>Red 85 GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.gmemd.com/locomotives/naf/images/sd70sm.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||AusFiero||10-11-2001||03:24 AM||||If it is a Hilux they are a fairly common swap over here. If a kit stateside seems to expensive give me a yell. Your $ is worth twice the AUS $ so it may be cheaper to get a kit here.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
